    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Budget Bills",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S2804D\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act\nmaking appropriations for the support of government\n\n                       CAPITAL PROJECTS BUDGET\n\nSummary:\nThis is the Capital Projects appropriation bill for State Fiscal Year\n(SFY) 2011-12. It includes General Fund, appropriations of $92.7\nmillion.\n\nJustification:\nThis bill provides for the ongoing Aid to Localities appropriations\nfor SFY 2011-12.\n\nFiscal Impact:\nThis appropriation bill authorizes disbursements up to $92.7 million\nin the General Fund and up to $7.7 billion in All Funds.\n\nEffective Date:\nEffective immediately and the appropriations contained in this bill\nshall be available for the fiscal year beginning April 1, 2011.\n\n",
